=== I2S START/DROP stress: 100 cycles, TX starved every 5 ===

slab : free blocks per direction, read BEFORE each cycle. It must stay

       at 8. Falling means the driver is losing the DMA's in-flight

       block on every DROP; rising above 8 means a block was freed

       twice and the free list has a cycle in it.

starve: TX is left to run dry, which drives the driver down its

       tx_disable path -- the one place the leak fix could double-free.

